# What Blender drops for the Forge to import (engine plan Phase 9 stage L).
# The glTF is TRANSPORT, not source: the Forge converts it to a `.forge` under
# assets/meshes/ and that is what gets committed. The directory itself is
# tracked so the addon has somewhere to write on a fresh clone.
blender-inbox/*
!blender-inbox/README.md
